v 3
d nnsreg: Nonlinear Nonparametric Statistics regression for Stata
d
d Univariate NNS regression: partitions the data, computes regression
d points, and represents the fitted curve as a linear spline with
d data-driven knots. Includes predict and estat postestimation and the
d three example datasets used in the help file (copy them to the current
d folder with net get nnsreg).
d
d Author: Eric A. Booth
d Requires: Stata 16
d Distribution-Date: 20261114
d License: MIT
f code/nnsreg.ado
f code/nnsreg_p.ado
f code/nnsreg_estat.ado
f code/nnsreg.sthlp
f data/texas_education.dta
f data/texas_water.dta
f data/clustered_peak_dip.dta
